---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="外部基軸大廳 - 邊際世界">
  <div class="portal-page">
    <a href="/" class="back-link">
      <span class="back-arrow">←</span>
      <span>返回世界的軸心</span>
    </a>

    <div class="portal-header">
      <div class="portal-icon-wrapper">
        <div class="icon-glow"></div>
        <div class="portal-icon">✦</div>
      </div>
      <h1 class="portal-title">外部基軸大廳</h1>
      <p class="portal-desc">
        這是一座華麗程度不亞於一開始的廳堂，不過是以金色的主題居多。<br />
        你見到五道光柱正佇立在遠方，指示著類似於傳送門的大型結構。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="portals-grid">
      <a
        href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCkXbkOgGRKhn5umbeYv-78A"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="portal-card active"
      >
        <div class="portal-light"></div>
        <div class="portal-content">
          <div class="portal-icon-small">📹</div>
          <h3 class="portal-card-title">世界的紀錄永不停歇</h3>
          <p class="portal-card-desc">通往影像記錄的世界</p>
          <div class="portal-button">
            <span>前往 YouTube</span>
            <span class="arrow">→</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a
        href="https://github.com/Unforgettableeternalproject"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="portal-card active"
      >
        <div class="portal-light"></div>
        <div class="portal-content">
          <div class="portal-icon-small">⚙️</div>
          <h3 class="portal-card-title">不斷更新進步的齒輪</h3>
          <p class="portal-card-desc">通往程式碼與專案的世界</p>
          <div class="portal-button">
            <span>前往 GitHub</span>
            <span class="arrow">→</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a
        href="https://www.bandlab.com/u_e_p"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="portal-card active"
      >
        <div class="portal-light"></div>
        <div class="portal-content">
          <div class="portal-icon-small">🎸</div>
          <h3 class="portal-card-title">音樂本質存在於靈魂</h3>
          <p class="portal-card-desc">通往音樂創作的世界</p>
          <div class="portal-button">
            <span>前往 BandLab</span>
            <span class="arrow">→</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a
        href="https://discord.com/invite/ARyrkB9F7Z"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="portal-card active"
      >
        <div class="portal-light"></div>
        <div class="portal-content">
          <div class="portal-icon-small">💬</div>
          <h3 class="portal-card-title">一個人無法組成社會</h3>
          <p class="portal-card-desc">通往社群交流的世界</p>
          <div class="portal-button">
            <span>前往 Discord</span>
            <span class="arrow">→</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <div class="portal-card damaged">
        <div class="portal-light damaged-light"></div>
        <div class="portal-content">
          <div class="portal-icon-small">❓</div>
          <h3 class="portal-card-title">？？？</h3>
          <p class="portal-card-desc">
            最後一道光柱感覺有些奇怪，散發著微微的橘色光線，<br />
            而且紀錄的部分似乎也損壞了...
          </p>
          <div class="portal-button disabled">
            <span>尚未修復</span>
            <span class="glitch">⚠</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    .portal-page {
      max-width: 1400px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 3rem;
    }

    @keyframes pageEnter {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(30px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    .back-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--gold);
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
      background: rgba(213, 182, 24, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(213, 182, 24, 0.3);
      border-radius: 12px;
      transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .back-link:hover {
      background: rgba(213, 182, 24, 0.2);
      transform: translateX(-8px);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(213, 182, 24, 0.2);
    }

    .back-arrow {
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .back-link:hover .back-arrow {
      transform: translateX(-4px);
    }

    .portal-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 4rem;
    }

    .portal-icon-wrapper {
      position: relative;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes float {
      0%,
      100% {
        transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg);
      }
      50% {
        transform: translateY(-15px) rotate(180deg);
      }
    }

    .icon-glow {
      position: absolute;
      inset: -30px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--gold) 0%, transparent 70%);
      opacity: 0.4;
      animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0%,
      100% {
        opacity: 0.3;
        transform: scale(1);
      }
      50% {
        opacity: 0.6;
        transform: scale(1.2);
      }
    }

    .portal-icon {
      font-size: 6rem;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 20px var(--gold));
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .portal-title {
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--gold);
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      text-shadow: 0 0 30px var(--gold);
    }

    .portal-desc {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .portals-grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .portal-card {
      position: relative;
      background: rgba(26, 26, 46, 0.6);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      border: 2px solid var(--gold);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 2.5rem;
      transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
      display: block;
      overflow: hidden;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .portal-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(213, 182, 24, 0.1), transparent);
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.4s ease;
    }

    .portal-card.active:hover::before {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .portal-card.active:hover {
      transform: translateY(-10px);
      border-color: var(--cyan);
      box-shadow:
        0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5),
        0 0 60px rgba(213, 182, 24, 0.3);
    }

    .portal-card.damaged {
      opacity: 0.6;
      border-color: #f97316;
      cursor: not-allowed;
    }

    .portal-light {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 50%;
      width: 2px;
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--gold), transparent);
      opacity: 0.6;
      animation: lightBeam 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes lightBeam {
      0%,
      100% {
        opacity: 0.4;
        transform: translateX(-50%) scaleY(1);
      }
      50% {
        opacity: 0.8;
        transform: translateX(-50%) scaleY(1.2);
      }
    }

    .portal-light.damaged-light {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f97316, transparent);
      animation: glitchBeam 0.5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes glitchBeam {
      0%,
      100% {
        opacity: 0.3;
      }
      50% {
        opacity: 0.6;
        transform: translateX(-50%) scaleX(3);
      }
    }

    .portal-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .portal-icon-small {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      display: inline-block;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(213, 182, 24, 0.5));
      animation: iconBob 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes iconBob {
      0%,
      100% {
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
      50% {
        transform: translateY(-5px);
      }
    }

    .portal-card-title {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--gold);
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .portal-card-desc {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .portal-button {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--cyan), var(--purple));
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
    }

    .portal-card.active:hover .portal-button {
      transform: scale(1.05);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.5);
    }

    .portal-button .arrow {
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .portal-card.active:hover .arrow {
      transform: translateX(5px);
    }

    .portal-button.disabled {
      background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.3);
      cursor: not-allowed;
      box-shadow: none;
    }

    .glitch {
      animation: glitchAnim 0.3s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes glitchAnim {
      0%,
      100% {
        opacity: 1;
      }
      50% {
        opacity: 0.3;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .portal-page {
        padding: 2rem 1rem;
      }

      .portal-icon {
        font-size: 4rem;
      }

      .portal-title {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
      }

      .portal-desc {
        font-size: 1rem;
      }

      .portal-card {
        padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
      }

      .portal-card-title {
        font-size: 1.4rem;
      }

      .portal-icon-small {
        font-size: 2rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
